//ARMOR OF MISSILE ATTRACTION +2 - 3500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/LEAT06.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Studded Leather Armor"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Studded leather armor has little in common with normal leather armor. Instead of a hardened shell, studded leather offers hundreds of metal rivets affixed to a supple backing. The numerous studs form a flexible coat of metal that helps to turn aside slashing and cutting attacks, while the leather is little more than a means of securing the rivets in place. 

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 7 (5 vs. slashing, 6 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -1
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 25
"

	SAY NAME2 "Armor of Missile Attraction +2"
	SAY DESC "This odd-looking suit of studded leather cannot be removed once put on, except under intervention by a priest. While improving a great protection against all melee weapons, this armor actually becomes a target for missile weapons, and hence so does its wearer. The choice is simple: deadly arrows or deadly swords. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– May only be removed with a Remove Curse spell
– Crushing Damage Resistance: +10%
– Slashing Damage Resistance: +10%
– Piercing Damage Resistance: +10%

Armor Class: 5 (3 vs. slashing, 4 vs. piercing, 15 vs. missile)
Speed Factor: -1
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 10"






