//GRANDMASTER'S ARMOR +5 - solo ladri e assassini (no spadaccini) - 16000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/LEAT24.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Studded Leather Armor"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Studded leather armor has little in common with normal leather armor. Instead of a hardened shell, studded leather offers hundreds of metal rivets affixed to a supple backing. The numerous studs form a flexible coat of metal that helps to turn aside slashing and cutting attacks, while the leather is little more than a means of securing the rivets in place. 

STATISTICS:

Armor Class: 7 (5 vs. slashing, 6 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -1
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 25
"

	SAY NAME2 "Grandmaster's Armor +5"
	SAY DESC "This extraordinary suit of armor is the pinnacle of the leatherworker's craft, commissioned by the legendary Grandmaster of the Shadow Thieves of Athkatla. It was designed for an operative who required the protection of heavy plate but the silence and flexibility of a second skin. The Grandmaster's Armor is more than just a defensive garment; it is a masterpiece of kinetic enchantment. The suit is magically attuned to the wearer's movements, anticipating every dodge and roll, and actually enhancing the user's natural speed. It is whispered that the first master who wore this armor could walk through a room full of dry leaves without making a sound, and dance between raindrops during a storm.  

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Doubles Movement Rate

Charge abilities:
- Dimension Door at will

Armor Class: 2 (0 vs. slashing, 1 vs. piercing and missile)
Speed Factor: -1
Requires:
 7 Strength

Weight: 5"
















